/P 104 0 R
/E (Our HCFM Muted Gold symbolizes sacredness, light. This color is typically used for borders and other decorative elements in a more traditional and reverent setting. The Muted Gold can be used as backgrounds in some cases, if necessary, but it should be kept in mind that this color does not always provide a readable canvas for text. White text is recommended for these cases.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
275 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 104 0 R
/E (HCFM Marian Blue is a secondary brand color used to support and enhance our primary palette. It is closely associated with Mary, reflecting her presence, gentleness, and guidance within our mission. It is best used for: Accents and highlights; Decorative elements and borders; Paired with Playlist Script or for Call to Actions for gentle emphasis.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [18]
>>
endobj
276 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 104 0 R
/E (White is an essential supporting color in the HCFM palette. White provides visual rest and balance, allowing other brand colors and elements to stand out clearly. Ideal for: Text on dark backgrounds; Clean backgrounds for layouts and documents; and Negative space to improve readability and focus. White helps ensure strong contrast when pairing White with darker colors.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [19]
>>
endobj
